    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda yaagha Noa n'abaana be enkabi, yaabakoba ati: “Muzaale, mwale, mwidhuze ensi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli nsolo, buli nhonhi, buli kyeghaluliza ku itaka era na buli kyanhandha ebyo byonabyona biidha kubatyanga. Byonabyona biteereibwa mu buyinza bwaimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiisi kiramu ekitambula kinaabanga kya kulya kyaimwe byonabyona mbibaghaire, nga bwe nabagha n'ebimera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye kye mutateekwa kulya, n'emamba ng'erimu omusaayi; kuba omusaayi n'obulamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.7.26+LEV.7.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 7:26-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.17.10+LEV.17.11+LEV.17.12+LEV.17.13+LEV.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17:10-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ole bw'anaazikirizanga obulamu obw'omuntu, aidha kuvunaanibwanga era abonerezebwe. N'ensolo dhoona dhiidha kubonerezebwanga olw'okuzikiriza obulamu obw'omuntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu yakolebwa mu mboneka ya Katonda: Kale ole bw'anaitanga omuntu, yeena aidhanga kwitibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Imwe muzaale era mwale, mwidhuze ensi era mugifuge.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Katonda yaakoba Noa ni batabane be ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bona, ndi kukola endagaano yange n'imwe, era n'eizaire lyaimwe erinairangagho ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "era na buli kiramu ekiri n'imwe, enhonhi, ensolo enfuge n'edh'omu nsiko, byonabyona ebyafuluma mu lyato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndi kukola endagaano yange n'imwe nti: ebiramu tibikairayo kuzikirizibwa mwidhuzo gwa maadhi kabiri, era omwidhuzo tigukairayo kubaagho kuzikiriza nsi kabiri.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katonda yaakoba ati: “Kano n'akamanhiso akooleka endagaano ey'ebyanda n'ebyanda, ye ndi kukola n'imwe, era ni buli kitonde ekiramu ekiri n'imwe: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndi kuta akalaso kange mu bire, kabe akamanhiso akooleka endagaano ye nkoze n'ensi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale bwe nnaaleetanga ebire ku nsi, akalaso ako ni kaboneka mu bire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ndidha kwidhukiranga endagaano yange ye nkoze n'imwe, era ye nkoze na buli kitonde ekiramu. Era amaadhi tigakairamu kufuuka mwidhuzo kabiri okuzikiriza ebiramu byonabyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe kanaabonekanga mu bire, ndidhanga kukalingaku ndidhukire endagaano etawaagho ye nkoze na buli kitonde ekiramu kyonakyona ekiri mu nsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ako n'akamanhiso akooleka endagaano ye nkoze n'ebiramu byonabyona ebiri ku nsi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batabane ba Noa abaafuluma mu lyato ni bano: Shemu, Hamu ni Yafethi. Hamu oyo n'eyazaala Kanaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo bonsatuli Noa n'eyabazaala era mu abo n'omwava abantu abaidhula ensi yoonayoona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noa n'eyasookereza okuba omulimi era yaasimba eisamba ery'emizabbibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe yanhwa ku mwenge ogw'emizabbibu, yaatamiira, yaatoolamu engoye yaasigala madu mu weema ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamu, lata wa Kanaani, yaabona nga ise ali madu, yaafuluma, yaakobera baganda be bale ababiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Shemu ni Yafethi baatoola ekivaalo, baakigemera einhuma ku mabega gaibwe. Baatambula ekyeinhumainhuma, baingira mu weema, baaghemba iseibwe eyali amadu, nga tibamulinzeeku ku mubona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noa omwenge bwe gwamuwa ku mutwe, n'ategeera omwana we asembayo obuto ky'amukoze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaakoba ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
